# Which configuration each kind of engine component runs on.
#
# A value here names a FILE, it does not hold one: `llm=openai` means this
# repository runs on config/llm/openai.json. The configurations sit side by
# side under config/<kind>/, each complete and readable on its own, so
# switching is a one-word edit that reads as a choice.
#
# No secret belongs in any of them. A configuration names the VARIABLE holding
# a key — never a key — so these files are safe to commit and the credential
# stays in .env.
#
# A process reads this once, at boot, and announces what it read. Editing it
# under a running process changes nothing until that process restarts.

llm=openai
